@name     string_slot_store
@alias    s>
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_string_slot_store
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  save string from parser buffer into memory slot
@doc
Stores string from active parser buffer into slot (0..15).
Usage: [string] s> slot
@code
    return skode_exec_s_gt(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
